# Arcwright

When the user is working with Arcwright (https://arcwrightai.com) or asks for an ask-before-write / diff-first build flow:

- Use the Arcwright MCP tools (`start_build`, `build_status`) instead of inventing HTTP calls.
- Never print or log `ARCWRIGHT_API_KEY` or other secrets.
- Summarize build results so the user can review diffs (in Arcwright desktop or in the editor) before accepting changes.
- If the hosted MCP URL is still a placeholder, say so clearly and point to the plugin README TODO.
